270
00:20:03,480 --> 00:20:04,900
Tá bom.

271
00:20:05,190 --> 00:20:05,980
Até amanhã.

272
00:20:10,310 --> 00:20:10,900
Irmão,

273
00:20:11,660 --> 00:20:12,900
