478
00:31:11,400 --> 00:31:12,750
Vamos para casa. Para casa, para casa.

479
00:31:12,750 --> 00:31:13,290
Tangtang, Tangtang!

480
00:31:13,550 --> 00:31:15,070
Tangtang, Tangtang.

481
00:31:27,250 --> 00:31:30,900
