485
00:31:45,750 --> 00:31:47,090
Ele, ele, ele...

486
00:31:47,220 --> 00:31:48,550
O problema é com ele.

487
00:31:50,830 --> 00:31:51,540
Tangtang.

488
00:31:53,110 --> 00:31:54,250
Yun Li,

489
00:31:56,090 --> 00:31:58,180
